        "code": "def gauss_lemma_legendre(a, p):\n    a = a % p\n    if a == 0: return 0\n    half = p // 2\n    n = sum(1 for k in range(1, (p-1)//2+1) if (a*k)%p > half)\n    return (-1) ** n",
