        "pseudocode": "INPUT: n (vertices), p (edge probability)\nOUTPUT: n * (1-p)^(n-1)\nComplexity: O(log n)",
        "code": "def isolated_vertex_expectation(n: int, p: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"E[isolated vertex count] = n * (1-p)^(n-1)\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0: return 0.0\n    return n * (1 - p) ** (n - 1)\n\n# Example\nprint(isolated_vertex_expectation(100, 0.05))",
